<Base title="About" description="About Gianluca Nordio.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Gianluca Nordio, a robotics software engineer at Robotize, based in Copenhagen. My work is
      mostly ROS 2, perception and mobile robots. I hold an M.Sc. in Autonomous Systems from DTU and
      an M.Sc. in Computer Engineering from the University of Padua.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site collects my notes: technical ones on robotics, localization and reinforcement
      learning, write-ups of personal projects, and essays on books and endurance sport.
    </p>
    <p>
      My <a href="/cv/">CV</a> has the details. You can find my code on
      <a href="https://github.com/GianlucaNordio">GitHub</a> and me on
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gianluca-nordio">LinkedIn</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
